 "widgets": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 24,
   "height": 3,
   "properties": {
    "markdown": "## Baker's Crumbs - operations dashboard\nWhy these alarm thresholds: **CPU > 85% for 10 min** and **memory > 90% for 5 min** leave headroom on one 8 GB server before containers are killed; **disk > 85% for 1 h** gives time to clean up logs before the disk fills; **any HTTP 5xx** or **status-check failure** means the site is broken now; **> 5% failed answers in 15 min** catches a broken model or key while the site still looks up; **any empty answer in 30 min** means the bakery documents are missing; **average answer > 10 s** is slower than Gemini's normal 2-6 s. All alarms email bakers-crumbs-alerts."
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "metric",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3,
   "width": 8,
   "height": 6,
   "properties": {
    "title": "Requests (HTTP, all pages)",
    "region": "us-east-1",
    "metrics": [
     [
      "BakersCrumbs",
      "HttpRequests",
      {
       "label": "HTTP requests"
      }
     ]
    ],
    "stat": "Sum",
    "period": 300,
    "view": "timeSeries"
   }
  },
